00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:26.800
So now we are all back
for Talk 2, which--

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:30.250
so recall the outline was
Talk 1, this basic paradigm,

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:32.400
which now we've seen--

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.240
OK, not quite fair
to say we've seen it

